  <body>
    <section name="IllegalBlockTag">
      <p>Since Checkstyle 13.10.0</p>
      <subsection name="Description" id="IllegalBlockTag_Description">
        <div>
          Detects a user-defined Javadoc block tag and reports a violation when the tag
          is present with text that does not match <code>tagTextPattern</code>.
          With the default pattern <code>$^</code> (matches nothing), any presence of the
          configured tag is a violation. No violation is reported when there is no
          Javadoc or when <code>tag</code> is not configured.
        </div>
      </subsection>

